      "text": "Fig. 4: histogram of formula aspect ratios. Y-axis 'Count' with ticks 0, 2500, 5000, 7500, 10000; x-axis 'Aspect ratio' 1 to 38. Bars peak at ratio 2 (about 9000) and 1 (about 8400), then fall steadily (about 5000 at 3, 4500 at 4, 2900 at 5) to near zero beyond about 20.",
